{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotGenusFourUnique","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnotGenusFourUnique","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Nat.GCD.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.IntervalCases"],"declarations":11,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.genus_four_crossing_numbers","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.genus_four_crossing_numbers","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L76-L87","doc":"The crossing numbers of the unique genus-4 pair are `9` and `10`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.torus_knot_genus_four_unique","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.torus_knot_genus_four_unique","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L45-L74","doc":"**Proposition (genus-4 torus knot uniqueness)**.\n\nThe only torus knots of genus `4` (under the canonical\n`m ≤ n`, `gcd(m,n) = 1` ordering) are `T_{2,9}` and `T_{3,5}`.\n\nProof: `genus = (m-1)(n-1)/2 = 4` (floor division) forces\n`(m-1)(n-1) ∈ {8, 9}`.  Since `m-1 ≥ 1` and `n-1 ≥ 1`, both\nfactors are `≤ 9`, bounding `m, n ≤ 10`; a finite case split\n(`interval_cases`) with the coprimality hypothesis leaves exactly\n`(2,9)` and `(3,5)` — the cofactor cases `(2,10)` and `(4,4)` are\neliminated by `gcd ≠ 1`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:torus-knot-genus-four-unique","label":"prop:torus-knot-genus-four-unique","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/torus-knot-genus-four-unique.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.crossingNumber","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L37-L41","doc":"Crossing number of a torus knot: `c = (m-1)n` for `m ≤ n`.\nThis is the standard torus-knot formula `min ((m-1)n) (m(n-1))`;\nunder the built-in hypothesis `m ≤ n` we have `(m-1)n ≤ m(n-1)`,\nso the minimum is `(m-1)n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.genus","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L34-L35","doc":"Genus of a torus knot: `g = (m-1)(n-1)/2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.coprime","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.coprime","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_le_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_le_n","kind":"theorem","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L27-L27","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_ge_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m_ge_two","kind":"theorem","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L26-L26","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.n","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.m","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L24-L24","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TorusKnot","kind":"structure","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TorusKnotGenusFourUnique.lean#L22-L28","doc":"A torus knot `T_{m,n}` with `2 ≤ m ≤ n`, `gcd(m,n) = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}